{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tea for Sana is a game about observing your surroundings and interpreting narrative clues to solve the mysteries of the mountain. You play as Vesna, a healer who is losing her memory. You'll need to remember your recipes, cook for people in distress, and explore old ruins to heal yourself and ascend to the role of a spirit healer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Sana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sana, an old friend, is hiding her eyes. To find out what's troubling her, you'll need to make her favourite tea. As you seek out the right recipe and ingredients, you'll unlock new ways to restore balance between the mountain spirits and the people who live among them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/513a056cac4e1be68a79655acd9b2396.poster.avif?t=1763112982\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/513a056cac4e1be68a79655acd9b2396.webm?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/513a056cac4e1be68a79655acd9b2396.mp4?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember your recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your hands, cooking has the power to heal and shed light on a person's internal landscape. You can trigger memories of your most potent recipes by exploring the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/150a040dd7185962e64f2807b0707816.poster.avif?t=1763112982\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/150a040dd7185962e64f2807b0707816.webm?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/150a040dd7185962e64f2807b0707816.mp4?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather the right ingredients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain is full of plants, flowers, and herbs you can use for cooking. If you look closely, you're sure to find some less conventional ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/d2e994ac76abe1b46aeaa8cfc7bcf1ef.poster.avif?t=1763112982\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/d2e994ac76abe1b46aeaa8cfc7bcf1ef.webm?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/d2e994ac76abe1b46aeaa8cfc7bcf1ef.mp4?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heal with cooking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook a mix of traditional Slavic dishes, drinks from distant lands, and a few strange concoctions to heal the physical and spiritual ailments of the people you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/6b18ba40ed41473a329c8584688eae64.poster.avif?t=1763112982\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/6b18ba40ed41473a329c8584688eae64.webm?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/6b18ba40ed41473a329c8584688eae64.mp4?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend to your new role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a budding spirit healer, you have a unique insight into the mischievous beings who dwell in the mountain. Spirits feed on the thoughts of living beings to shape the physical world. You'll learn how to tame them and help people whose thoughts have transformed their reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/819cbfd221f371402e486182fd6b7439.poster.avif?t=1763112982\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/819cbfd221f371402e486182fd6b7439.webm?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/819cbfd221f371402e486182fd6b7439.mp4?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't lose hope</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time you'll unravel a story about healing, overcoming grief, and starting over in a new land. There is darkness on the path, but stay strong. Every bit of progress brings you closer to healing yourself and helping Sana find peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/a58d274fb552b37a1e4b4f31d12308e5.poster.avif?t=1763112982\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/a58d274fb552b37a1e4b4f31d12308e5.webm?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976880/extras/a58d274fb552b37a1e4b4f31d12308e5.mp4?t=1763112982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Namesake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/bb255fc54893a1fee11633b373d9563bd06613b5.jpg"},{"name":"A fresh start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/4c77d7e71b70d4ef715a996012eda32eb94834cf.jpg"},{"name":"A new perspective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/9e4f3d238a236ebedc7d93298cdac564caa8a2f7.jpg"},{"name":"Soulless puppet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/fe32e481b5553ecbeebd2f83bd61fe4ae662f1b4.jpg"},{"name":"Restoration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/adf1891c06c44d03a2590e3f0023e1fed9762712.jpg"},{"name":"Little dumpling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/14855dd7c7b17edddd6542ef3b1be03007df9f6e.jpg"},{"name":"Tough nut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/6cbef9c9cf4026d35348b291cf67c71ce40a1c75.jpg"},{"name":"P-p-pickles, please","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/c260384907e4a90372150a8361144a011f31dba0.jpg"},{"name":"Cooking witch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/0aa40fca0d0b50086e20bff002fe38a2485fc26e.jpg"},{"name":"Librarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976880/4bbc32f978097f0bd7451ea405f72f0c3db4e523.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2976880?t=1763112982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s